  "title": "Wipro, SNP SE enter into a strategic partnership to accelerate enterprise transformation for customers globally",
  "summary": "Bangalore, India and Heidelberg, Germany – November 16, 2020: Wipro Limited (NYSE: WIT, BSE: 507685, NSE: WIPRO), a leading global information technology, consulting and business process services company, and SNP Schneider-Neureither & Partner SE, a world-leading provider of software solutions for digital transformation processes and automated data migration, today announced a strategic partnership to help customers accelerate their enterprise transformation journey.",
